OL,3,GNEWSA'Hurt' at lack of clarity over SEN
OL,4,Ataxi - 24 hours before girl, 7, returns
OL,5,Ato school
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man whose daughter has special
OL,8,Feducational needs has said it is
OL,9,F"hurtful and deeply frustrating" that
OL,10,Fthe Education Authority (EA) still has
OL,11,Fnot clarified what taxi firm will take
OL,12,Fher to and from school.
OL,14,FSeven-year-old Maisie was using a taxi
OL,15,Fcompany provided by the EA but the
OL,16,Fcontract has now gone out to tender.
OL,18,FHer father Columba Mailey said
OL,19,F"familiarity with the driver is crucial
OL,20,Ffor Maisie" adding that "24 hours
OL,21,Fbefore Maisie starts the new term we
OL,22,Fhave no clarity".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
